Hi Caroline,

It was a bug in the CensusToCaptHist function: thanks for spotting it! 
I have attached a new version function which you can cut and paste into R and use straight away.

I have also updated the package on R-Forge and in a few hours the new version should be available for download using: 
install.packages("BaSTA", repos="http://R-Forge.R-project.org",type="source")

Note that you can now use the function to get a weekly/daily observation matrix directly from a properly formatted date:

#To coerce into daily data
Y = CensusToCaptHist(captHist$ID, captHist$Date, timeInt="D")

#To coerce into weekly data
Y = CensusToCaptHist(captHist$ID, captHist$Date, timeInt="W")

Best wishes,

Owen


